    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8899\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of\nthe city of Yonkers\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2024 to June 30, 2025.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one extends the City of Yonkers' authorization to issue bonds\nand notes through negotiated sale to June 30, 2025.\n\nSection two is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2024 to June 30, 2025. The authori-\nzation for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales of its bonds or notes\nis vital to improving the city's financial stability and independence.\nThe city's bonding authority will expire on June 30, 2024 unless it is\nextended for one year. The continuation of this power will allow more\ncost-effective financing for the city of Yonkers.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2023 - S400 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 168\n\n2022 - S8387 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 332\n\n2021 - S1033 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 168\n\n2020 - S7508B (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 58\n\n2019 - S3405 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 71\n\n2018 - S7352 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 81\n\n2017 - S6720 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 44\n\n2016 - S6355 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 45\n\n2015 - S3463 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 21\n\n2014 - S6313 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 70\n\n2013 - S3020 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 69\n\n2012 - S6460 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 72\n\n2011 - S2982 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 66\n\n2010 - S6720 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 125\n2009 - S3336 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 77\n\n2008 - S6878 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 144\n\n2007 - S4137 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 80\n\n2006 - S6701 (Spano); Chapter 122\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
